    "summary": "In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), spend 1 CP on one **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit of yours that has yet to be picked this phase to either shoot or fight. Choose one of two abilities, [[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits) and [[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits); while the phase lasts, the unit's weapons have the chosen one, but its models may aim their attacks only at **PSYKER** units.",
